Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:55.34,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15\shad0\c&HF2F2F1&\3c&H89828F&\bord1\fad(1380,1)\pos(124,143.5)}Sot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:55.34,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs14\shad0\c&HFCF4DF&\3c&HFEC050&\pos(594,36)\fad(1380,1)}Kaos
